---
import { GITHUB } from "../utils/site";
---

<footer class="mt-28 border-t border-white/10 bg-[#0b0b0c]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-medium tracking-tight text-[#f3f3f1]">
          <img src="/pumpy/assets/airdrop-mark.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" />
          <span class="text-base">Airdrop®</span>
        </a>
        <p class="max-w-sm text-xs text-[#959595]">
          Atualizações Over-the-Air para React Native. Assinatura ECDSA P-256, rollout canário e auto-rollback na sua infra.
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 text-xs text-[#b5b5b3]">
        <a href="/docs/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">Docs</a>
        <a href="/docs/getting-started/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">Getting Started</a>
        <a href="/dashboard/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">Console</a>
        <a href="/docs/security/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">Security</a>
        <a href="/terms/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">Terms</a>
        <a href="/privacy/" class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">Privacy</a>
        <a href={GITHUB} class="transition-colors hover:text-[#f3f3f1]">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
